What this proves: what the installed shortcut points at, how many Hubs and shells one
click produces from cold, warm and hidden states, what an invalid directory does, and
that a shell started outside the Hub is untouched.
What it cannot prove: which session the window selected (needs the devtools protocol),
and icon appearance. Those are the manual steps in docs/SHORTCUT_ENTRY_ACCEPTANCE.md.
